From ec4111da6927e510297a365eeb6f5d48305bbd8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeheartgold-3ds-bootstrap <bootstrap@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:13:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Drop static where an internal header declares the function

berry_pots_app_internal.h declares BerryPotsApp_StartGrowthAnims and the
Handle/Get helpers, and comm_state_private.h declares the CommState_* state
functions, without static. GCC rejects the static definitions and forward
declarations at src/berry_pots_app_tasks.c:202 and src/comm_state.c:150 with
"static declaration ... follows non-static declaration". Under SDK_PORT_3DS a
file-scope macro expands to nothing so the definitions match the headers; on
the DS it expands to static, so the preprocessed text is unchanged (0 diff
lines for both files without the macro). MWCC keeps its file-scope symbols
static, and the DS build sees the same linkage.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/berry_pots_app_tasks.c |  27 ++--
 src/comm_state.c           | 317 +++++++++++++++++++------------------
 2 files changed, 181 insertions(+), 163 deletions(-)

